47:aptu-coder is a comprehension layer for coding agents: it gives an agent harness precise structural context about a codebase, directory trees, and symbol definitions, without the agent reading raw files or re-deriving structure on every call. That prevents context starvation on large or unfamiliar codebases while keeping the result set small enough to fit the model's context window. It supports 18 languages (see [Supported Languages](#supported-languages)) and integrates with any MCP-compatible orchestrator.
